<title>UK: British retail prices rise 0.1 percent in November.</title>
<headline>British retail prices rise 0.1 percent in November.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>British retail prices rose 0.1 percent in November to leave annual inflation unchanged at 2.7 percent, official figures showed on Thursday.</p>
<p>The figures were in line with analysts's expectations.</p>
</text>
